      ],
      "en": "So they hanged Haman on the gallows that he had prepared for Mordecai. Then the king’s wrath was pacified.",
      "ko": "모르드개를 달고자 한 나무에 하만을 다니 왕의 노가 그치니라",
      "source_text_hash": "bb9bac51b473db1eb622b7b12b81ddc694baa8c1132b993f00c056fe8ae44075",
      "translation_text_hash": "c707b04f59ac8f0d8550af7dd42639d789117da06d99bb8e6cbe5ea832dc5606",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "모르드개를 달고자 한 나무에 하만을 다니 왕의 노가 그치니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "c707b04f59ac8f0d8550af7dd42639d789117da06d99bb8e6cbe5ea832dc5606"
      ]
